{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface is a first person linear exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you simply walk your way to the end. The point is to immerse yourself in this world presented to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are no mechanics besides movement and looking around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being mysterious by design the story isn't told explicitly, everything is up to interpretation, all you know is that you want to reach the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game does not contain monsters, the ambience and environments will invoke feelings of unease and even dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound, model and script was crafted by me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You have lived since birth in remote region of the megastructure, its not clear anymore how vast are its borders, you just want to see the surface once.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448840?t=1760032887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448840?t=1760032887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/1d0cbe68b0ba9d0a35c786185316e494deb11aef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760032887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/1d0cbe68b0ba9d0a35c786185316e494deb11aef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760032887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3450430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface is a first person linear exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you simply walk your way to the end. The point is to immerse yourself in this world presented to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are no mechanics besides movement and looking around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being mysterious by design the story isn't told explicitly, everything is up to interpretation, all you know is that you want to reach the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game does not contain monsters, the ambience and environments will invoke feelings of unease and even dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound, model and script was crafted by me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1760032887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras_big/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1760032887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You have lived since birth in remote region of the megastructure, its not clear anymore how vast are its borders, you just want to see the surface once.</i></p>","developers":["PurpleGoop"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/header.jpg?t=1760032887","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448840/825921/30ca9d8a213393c15742c06a2ef3517918771e7a/1750852171/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739186576","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3448840/825921/30ca9d8a213393c15742c06a2ef3517918771e7a/1750852171/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739186576","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vide